      ],
      "text": "included only 2 months of rifampicin, the extension of the intensive phase meant an extra month of",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        80.59070587158203,
        527.415771484375,
        95.03370666503906
      ],
      "text": "supervised rifampicin. This extra month is less important now as the current recommended regimen",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        93.79071807861328,
        527.4345092773438,
        108.23371887207031
      ],
      "text": "is 6 months of supervised rifampicin. Given these considerations, together with preliminary results",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        106.99073028564453,
        527.5357666015625,
        121.43373107910156
      ],
      "text": "from one moderate-certainty study that showed only modest benefit, a conditional recommendation",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.986041069030762,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        120.19074249267578,
        440.58160400390625,
        134.6337432861328
      ],
      "text": "was made not to extend treatment on the basis of a positive smear at 2 months.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        148.62188720703125,
        513.340087890625,
        173.41688537597656
      ],
      "text": "2. Treatment of drug-susceptible TB using 4-month",
      "font": "SegoeUI-SemiBold",
      "size": 19.0,
      "type": "heading_main"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        171.42193603515625,
        155.5281982421875,
        196.21693420410156
      ],
      "text": "regimens",
