      "size": 19.0,
      "type": "heading_main"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        207.75709533691406,
        228.47251892089844,
        228.63710021972656
      ],
      "text": "Recommendation 2.1",
      "font": "SegoeUI-SemiBold",
      "size": 16.0,
      "type": "heading_main"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        77.66929626464844,
        240.34259033203125,
        203.97349548339844,
        254.6975860595703
      ],
      "text": "No. Recommendation",
      "font": "SegoeUI-SemiBold",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        77.66929626464844,
        261.95709228515625,
        514.0943603515625,
        276.31207275390625
      ],
      "text": "2.1 People aged 12 years or older with drug-susceptible pulmonary TB, may receive",
      "font": "SegoeUI-SemiBold",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        112.86930084228516,
        273.95709228515625,
        494.46759033203125,
        288.31207275390625
      ],
      "text": "a 4-month regimen of isoniazid, rifapentine, moxifloxacin and pyrazinamide 5",
      "font": "SegoeUI-SemiBold",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        112.48127746582031,
        290.2091064453125,
        429.4815368652344,
        304.5640869140625
      ],
      "text": "(Conditional recommendation, moderate certainty of evidence)",
      "font": "SegoeUI-SemiBold",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        321.43951416015625,
        220.7113037109375,
        337.29150390625
      ],
      "text": "Source of recommendation",
      "font": "SegoeUI-BoldItalic",
      "size": 12.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        344.49951171875,
        527.43994140625,
        358.9425354003906
      ],
      "text": "This recommendation was developed following the advice of the GDG convened in April 2021 to",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        357.6994934082031,
        527.5062255859375,
        372.14251708984375
      ],
      "text": "review data from a randomized controlled trial that assessed the safety and effectiveness of 4-month",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.996599197387695,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        370.8995056152344,
        240.5015106201172,
        385.342529296875
      ],
      "text": "regimens for the treatment of DS-TB.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        398.7167053222656,
        216.29168701171875,
        414.5686950683594
      ],
      "text": "Justification and evidence",
      "font": "SegoeUI-BoldItalic",
      "size": 12.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        421.776611328125,
        527.3958740234375,
        436.2196350097656
      ],
      "text": "Since 2010, the WHO guidelines have recommended treating persons with DS-TB with a 6-month",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        434.9765930175781,
        527.1095581054688,
        449.41961669921875
      ],
      "text": "regimen composed of four first line TB medicines – isoniazid, rifampicin, ethambutol and pyrazinamide",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.956011772155762,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        446.9006042480469,
        527.3724365234375,
        462.61962890625
      ],
      "text": "(2) – where rifampicin is used for 6 months (2HRZE/4HR)  . This regimen is based on seminal TB",
      "font": "SegoeUI-LightItalic",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        460.1006164550781,
        527.4255981445312,
        475.81964111328125
      ],
      "text": "(3) treatment studies conducted by the British Medical Research Council in the 1980s   and has been",
      "font": "SegoeUI-LightItalic",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        474.57659912109375,
        527.4048461914062,
        489.0196228027344
      ],
      "text": "widely adopted worldwide. Using it, approximately 85% of patients will have a successful treatment",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        486.5006103515625,
        527.25537109375,
        502.2196350097656
      ],
      "text": "(25) outcome  . Despite its familiarity, safety and efficacy, many patients find the 6-month regimen",
      "font": "SegoeUI-LightItalic",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        500.9765625,
        527.435546875,
        515.4195556640625
      ],
      "text": "difficult to complete due to its length. In fact, long treatment regimens present serious challenges",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        514.1766357421875,
        396.4012145996094,
        528.61962890625
      ],
      "text": "both to patients and to the programmatic management of TB globally.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        535.880615234375,
        527.3903198242188,
        550.3236083984375
      ],
      "text": "Since the discovery of first-line anti-TB medicines and treatment regimens, there has been a search",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        549.08056640625,
        527.4375,
        563.5235595703125
      ],
      "text": "for shorter and more effective treatments for TB disease. This has resulted in various trials and other",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        562.2806396484375,
        527.4046020507812,
        576.7236328125
      ],
      "text": "studies designed to assess whether treatment can be shortened, while remaining highly effective.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        575.4805908203125,
        527.6104125976562,
        589.923583984375
      ],
      "text": "Three phase III trials (i.e. REMoxTB, OFLOTUB, RIFAQUIN) failed to demonstrate non-inferiority of",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        587.4046020507812,
        527.423583984375,
        603.1235961914062
      ],
      "text": "(12, 13, 26) shorter regimens to treat DS-TB  . A recent phase III trial (TBTC study 31/ACTG A5349, or",
      "font": "SegoeUI-LightItalic",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        601.8804931640625,
        527.5560302734375,
        616.323486328125
      ],
      "text": "S31/A5349, referred to below as “Study 31”) assessed the safety and efficacy of two 4-month regimens",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.963088035583496,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        613.8046264648438,
        527.4171142578125,
        629.5236206054688
      ],
      "text": "(27) for the treatment of DS-TB  . Study 31 was the first and only phase III trial to demonstrate the",
      "font": "SegoeUI-LightItalic",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        628.2806396484375,
        527.425537109375,
        642.7236328125
      ],
      "text": "non-inferiority of the 4-month regimen for treatment of DS-TB when compared to the standard of",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        640.20458984375,
        527.5051879882812,
        655.923583984375
      ],
      "text": "(28) care. The dedicated Cochrane review   in 2019 and the literature search for the period 2019–2021",
      "font": "SegoeUI-LightItalic",
      "size": 10.996699333190918,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        654.6806030273438,
        527.406005859375,
        669.1235961914062
      ],
      "text": "performed prior to the GDG failed to identify any studies other than Study 31; therefore this was the",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        667.8804931640625,
        297.5079040527344,
        682.323486328125
      ],
      "text": "only trial to provide evidence for this GDG review.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        689.58447265625,
        524.2122802734375,
        704.0274658203125
      ],
      "text": "Study 31 was an international, multicentre, randomized, open-label, controlled, three-arm non-",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        702.7844848632812,
        527.4195556640625,
        717.2274780273438
      ],
      "text": "inferiority trial among adolescents and adults (aged 12 years and above) with smear-positive  and  6",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        714.70849609375,
        527.4529418945312,
        730.427490234375
      ],
      "text": "[27] culture-positive pulmonary DS-TB  . Study participants were recruited from 13 countries. The",
      "font": "SegoeUI-LightItalic",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        740.6371459960938,
        524.1851196289062,
        751.14111328125
      ],
      "text": "Two months of isoniazid, rifapentine, moxifloxacin, and pyrazinamide, followed by two months of isoniazid, rifapentine, and moxifloxacin 5",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 7.986738681793213,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        752.1438598632812,
        526.6028442382812,
        763.5758666992188
      ],
      "text": "M. tuberculosis Smear positive for acid-fast bacilli on smear microscopy or smear positive for   by GeneXpert MTB/RIF  (“Xpert”, Cepheid  6\t ®",
      "font": "SegoeUI-LightItalic",
      "size": 7.9954986572265625,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        81.86609649658203,
        762.6719360351562,
        343.97412109375,
        773.1759033203125
      ],
      "text": "Inc., Sunnyvale, CA) testing with semi-quantitative result of “medium” or “high”.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
